        "Toast spices 1 minute in dry pot",
        "Blanch bones and brisket 2 minutes, rinse",
        "In clean pot, combine bones, brisket, charred ginger/onion, spices, water",
        "Simmer 2 hours minimum (3 hours better)",
        "Strain broth",
        "Cook brisket until tender, slice",
        "Cook rice noodles separately",
        "Assemble: noodles in bowl, thin beef slices",
        "Pour hot broth over (heat cooks raw beef)",
        "Top with fresh herbs, sprouts",
        "Serve with lime, chilies, fish sauce"
      ],
      "notes": "The broth requires long simmering for proper flavor",
      "fun_fact": "Phở is Vietnam's national dish and symbol of Vietnamese cuisine",
      "alternatives": [
